 club.\n\nOur discussion will feature Stanford Prof. Tobias Wolff’s novel
  Old School\, published in 2003. The renowned author is a master of the sh
 ort story and the memoir\, and a celebrated teacher of creative writing. T
 his is his first full-length novel. Our event will also be a celebration o
 f Toby\, the National Medal of Arts winning author who has contributed so 
